<title>CHINA: UBS sets Cheung Kong, Hutchison warrants.</title>
<headline>UBS sets Cheung Kong, Hutchison warrants.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Union Bank of Switzerland's Hong Kong branch said it launched 220 million American-style call warrants on Cheung Kong group basket.</p>
<p>Each basket comprises of:</p>
<p> Cheung Kong (Holdings) Ltd	0.09 shares</p>
<p> Hutchison Whampoa Ltd	     0.10 shares</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE     HK$15.75     PREMIUM	  16.65 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	HK$0.2622    GEARING	  6.01x</p>
<p> MATURITY	   05.JUN.98    PAYMENT DATE   25.AUG.97</p>
<p> LISTING	    HONG KONG    LISTING DATE   27.AUG.97</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE   HK$15.75     BOARD LOT	10,000</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
